    {
      "id": "experiment:stale-reads",
      "type": "Experiment",
      "label": "Reading what a stale graph reports helps, partly",
      "description": "What: hybrid and cards open the files kg status reports as modified or added. On the stale graph the score rises from 0.63 to 0.83, still below the code's 1.00, at three to four times the code's context.\nWhere: docs/benchmark.md; docs/report.md §A stale graph\nLearned: The bench called a bare kg that only exists with the virtualenv active; it now runs sys.executable -m kg.",
