    {
      "id": "decision:keep-graph-fresh",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "Keep the graph fresh: check, hooks, CI template",
      "description": "What: kg status --check exits 1 on a stale graph; pre-commit hooks kg-extract and kg-status; a copy-paste CI template; a bot that commits the graph is not recommended.\nWhy: The benchmark shows a stale graph is the costly case.\nWhere: docs/store.md §Keeping the graph fresh",
