    {
      "id": "decision:no-own-graph-committed",
      "type": "Decision",
      "label": "kg does not commit its own .kg/",
      "description": "What: kg's own graph is not committed, so the CI template does not run on this repo. #59's criterion 'tried on this repo's own workflow' was replaced on purpose: the hooks were tried with pre-commit try-repo on a demo repo instead.\nWhy: Merge conflicts: two PRs that touch code both change graph.json, so the second conflicts almost every time, and PR diffs grow about sixfold. Every contributor has kg and rebuilds the graph in about 2 s. Size (1.17 MB, 78 KB compressed) is not the problem.",
      "attrs": {
        "created": "2026-10-15",
        "session": "session:2026-10-15-4381279d",
        "status": "active"
      },
      "provenance": {
        "method": "manual",
